{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/290532ff76b3b804384b0430b953abe4.poster.avif?t=1765096555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/290532ff76b3b804384b0430b953abe4.webm?t=1765096555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/290532ff76b3b804384b0430b953abe4.mp4?t=1765096555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALTO</strong> is a 2D boss-rush action game focused entirely on deadly duels. There are no filler stages\u2014only relentless encounters against unique and brutal bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a dash (brief invulnerability) to slip through enemy attacks and strike in the same moment. Every mistake is punished, but every attempt teaches you to survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Content</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page and trailer reflect <strong>early development</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release features <strong>a total of five bosses</strong>.<strong></strong><br><br><br>All footage and screenshots are from a <strong>work-in-progress build</strong> and will continue to improve before launch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure boss-rush experience: every fight is a highlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss patterns and phases that test your reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who enjoy challenging and rewarding action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/7c77ac88d6ac7d158ce1b7dbb9dc37b3.avif?t=1765096555\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AI</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly all of the game\u2019s graphics\u2014including backgrounds, objects, and characters\u2014were pre-generated using AI tools, and then manually refined and edited by the developer for final use</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964330?t=1765096555","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/91fedff6580094fb73b54853034c78e72fe0e295/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765096555","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/aa9b1d7b90fef1b390958f32391ba7db76423893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765096555","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/aa9b1d7b90fef1b390958f32391ba7db76423893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765096555","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/290532ff76b3b804384b0430b953abe4.poster.avif?t=1765096555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/290532ff76b3b804384b0430b953abe4.webm?t=1765096555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/290532ff76b3b804384b0430b953abe4.mp4?t=1765096555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALTO</strong> is a 2D boss-rush action game focused entirely on deadly due